[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m shape, and the only feature combination is the default one (see Phase D).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Entry points:** `rgb_to_hsv` is simultaneously the lowest-level and the only
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m public entry point — there is no convenience wrapper above it and no internal
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m helper below it (the min/max reductions are open-coded ternaries, not calls). It
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m is therefore always exercised directly through its `.so` export, never via a
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m wrapper.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Input-shape axes the code special-cases** (each maps to a real branch or a
