[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    422[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // else branch would give 60*(4 + (r-g)/delta) = 60*5 = 300. Also equal.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    423[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     assert_eq!(b(out[0]), b(300.0));
