[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    455[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // {NaN, NaN, 1.0}: min: NaN<NaN false => NaN; NaN<1 false => 1 => min=1.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    456[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     //   Actually min = (min<g? min:g) with min=NaN,g=NaN => g = NaN;
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    457[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     //   then (NaN<1.0)? false => b = 1.0 => min = 1.0.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    458[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // max = (NaN>NaN? NaN : NaN) = NaN; (NaN>1.0)? false => 1.0 => max = 1.0.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    459[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // delta = 0 => early return. So use a shape where max stays NaN:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    460[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // {1.0, NaN, NaN}: min = (1<NaN? 1 : NaN) = NaN; (NaN<NaN? NaN:NaN)=NaN.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    461[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // max = (1>NaN? 1 : NaN) = NaN; (NaN>NaN? NaN : NaN) = NaN. delta = NaN.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    462[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // NaN==0 false, NaN==0 false => proceed. r==max: 1==NaN false.
