[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    530[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    531[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // E23 / E24 — null pointers. The C performs no null check (verified by grep:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    532[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // there is no `if (!src)` / `if (src == NULL)` anywhere), so both libraries
