[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mSYMBOLS.md[0m — the C [38;5;10m.so[0m exports exactly one symbol, [38;5;10mrgb_to_hsv[0m; the Rust [38;5;10m.so[0m exports it under the same name. [38;5;10mnm -D[0m diff is empty in both profiles, and there are no undefined non-libc references (nothing untranslated).[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mERRORS.md[0m — 26 rows. Grep confirmed the C contains zero error-return macros, asserts, null checks, and range checks, so every rejection is expressed as a specific output triple or as UB. Rows cover both disjuncts of the [38;5;10mdelta == 0 || max == 0[0m short-circuit independently, signed zeros, NaN in each position (including non-canonical and signalling payloads), [38;5;10m±inf[0m, [38;5;10mdelta[0m overflow, subnormals, the [38;5;10mh += 360[0m wrap and the [38;5;10mh == -0.0[0m case where it must [3mnot[23m fire, branch-priority ties, aliasing, and null pointers.[0m[0m
